{"item":{"cls":"Item","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/yellowstoneadvmoto\/items\/694384\/","pk":694384,"company":{"cls":"Company","uri":"\/api\/v1\/companies\/yellowstoneadvmoto\/","pk":128646,"shortname":"yellowstoneadvmoto","name":"Yellowstone Adventure Moto","processor_currency":"usd","display_processor_currency":"US dollars"},"name":"Self-Guided ADV Motorcycle Rental \u2013 KLR 650","is_retail":false,"is_archived":false,"is_private":true,"color":4,"unicode":"Self-Guided ADV Motorcycle Rental \u2013 KLR 650","is_bookable_ever_by_phone":true,"sold_out_text":"\u201cThis motorcycle is unavailable for online booking on this date.","cutoff_unreached_kind":"before-start","cutoff_unreached_hours":12.0,"is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book":true,"cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text":"\u201cThis motorcycle is unavailable for online booking on this date.","cutoff_reached_kind":"before-start","cutoff_reached_hours":12.0,"is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book":true,"cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text":"\u201cThis motorcycle is unavailable for online booking on this date.","minimum_initial_party_size":1,"minimum_subsequent_party_size":1,"maximum_initial_party_size":1,"maximum_subsequent_party_size":1,"auto_open_kind":"before-start","auto_open_hours":null,"is_waitlist_when_full":false,"is_unlisted":false,"booking_restriction":null,"is_card_required":false,"is_grouped_calendar":false,"is_free_allowed":true,"is_no_tax":true,"sortable_index":375,"description":"","description_text":"","description_bullets":"","seo_description":"","location":"","booking_notes":"Pickup \u0026 Drop-Off Service\nFor your convenience, I personally deliver and pick up each motorcycle at your hotel, Airbnb, or a designated meeting location within the Cody area.\n\nExact delivery location and timing will be confirmed prior to your ride.\nArrival Time\nPlease arrive 15\u201320 minutes early to allow time for paperwork, gear fitting, and a pre-ride briefing.\n\nLicense \u0026 Insurance Requirements\n\u2022 A valid motorcycle endorsement is required.\n\u2022 Riders must purchase MBA daily motorcycle insurance ($15\/day).\n\u2022 We will provide the VIN number for your assigned motorcycle to complete the MBA insurance. This can be done in advance or on the morning of the ride.\n\nRequired Riding Gear\n\u2022 Proper riding boots or sturdy hiking boots are required (no sneakers).\n\u2022 Most riding gear is included; however, sizes and quantities are limited.\n\u2022 We recommend bringing your own gear if you have specific sizing needs.\n\nWhat to Bring\n\u2022 Full water bottle\n\u2022 Sunglasses\n\u2022 Light jacket or sweater (weather can change quickly at elevation)\n\u2022 Snacks\n\u2022 Camera or phone for photos\n\nRide Conditions\nRides may include high elevations, changing weather, wildlife, paved mountain roads, and occasional dirt or gravel sections. Routes may be adjusted for safety due to weather or road conditions.\n\nQuestions or Changes\nIf you have any questions prior to your ride day, please contact us directly.","cancellation_notes":"Cancellations made 7 days or more prior to the scheduled rental date will receive a full refund, minus any non-refundable processing fees.\n\nCancellations made within 7 days of the scheduled rental date are non-refundable due to limited inventory and advance scheduling.\n\nWeather Disclaimer:\nWeather conditions in Wyoming can change rapidly. Rentals will proceed in light rain or variable conditions. Refunds are not provided due to weather unless conditions are deemed unsafe at the sole discretion of Yellowstone Adventure Moto.\n\nNo-Show Policy:\nFailure to arrive at the agreed delivery time and location without prior communication will be considered a no-show and is non-refundable.\n\nInsurance Requirement:\nRequired third-party insurance must be purchased separately prior to ride start. Failure to complete insurance requirements may result in cancellation without refund.","no_transportation_notes":"","no_transportation_minutes":15,"head